subsection.def:
Chinese armed force (中國武裝力量) means an armed force of China, that is the
                Chinese People’s Liberation Army, the Chinese People’s Armed Police Force or the
                militia;

designated judge (指定法官), in relation to a Court, means a judicial officer designated among
                the judicial officers of the Court under Article 44 of the HK National Security
                Law;

subparagraph.content:
